<h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;"><strong>Hit the Links with us for the 28<sup>th</sup> Annual Champions for Play Golf Outing!</strong></h1>
<h3 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 18px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 17px;"><strong>May 17, 2024</strong></h3>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Join us Friday, May 17 for the 28<sup>th</sup> annual Champions for PLAY Golf Outing, presented by the Chris and Lori Holtmann Foundation. Proceeds from the event provide economically disadvantaged youth in central Ohio with the opportunity to participate in fee-based enrichment and sports activities through Columbus Recreation and Parks Department.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">For more information and to register, visit <a href="https://columbusrecparks.com/connect/support/champions-for-play/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">ChampionsforPLAY.org</a> or contact Keiana Mitchell at <a href="mailto:kmmitchell@columbus.gov" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">KMMitchell@columbus.gov</a>. Space is limited so register today!</p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/01/8812956/5193783/play2023_crop.jpg" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="PLAY Golf Outing 2023" width="570" height="224">
